{"title":"2024年度以工代赈中央投资115亿元已下达！","date":"2024-05-14","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2024</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">年度以工代赈中央投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">115</span>亿元已下达！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">国家发改委近日表示，该部门会同财政部已下达<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年度以工代赈中央专项投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">115</span>亿元，支持地方实施以工代赈项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">2700</span>余个，计划发放劳务报酬<span lang=\"EN-US\">37</span>亿元，吸纳带动项目地农村民众<span lang=\"EN-US\">25</span>万人实现就地就近就业。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">以工代赈是指政府投资建设基础设施工程</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">，受赈济者参加工程建设获得劳务报酬，以此取代直接救济的一种扶持政策。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">据介绍，以工代赈中央资金主要投向<span lang=\"EN-US\">832</span>个脱贫县等欠发达地区，并向受暴雨洪涝灾害较重的京津冀等华北、东北地区以及积石山地震灾区相关的甘肃、青海两省予以倾斜，<b>重点支持劳务用工量大、技术门槛低、工程机械作业少的农村中小型基础设施建设项目。</b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">以工代赈项目将最大程度挖掘项目用工规模，最大可能吸纳当地民众参与建设，最大幅度提高劳务报酬发放占比。<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年，以工代赈项目计划发放劳务报酬占中央投资的比例达到<span lang=\"EN-US\">32%</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">25</span>万农村低收入民众将通过参与劳动和技能培训实现<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>既拿报酬、又长技能<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">以工代赈中央资金还将改善当地基础设施条件，强化&ldquo;一举多得&rdquo;&ldquo;一钱多用&rdquo;。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">全年计划修建通乡通村路、生产便道等各类道路<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.08</span>万公里，开展农田整治<span lang=\"EN-US\">15.48</span>万亩，开挖或铺设各类供排水管网<span lang=\"EN-US\">8.35</span>万公里，修建小型桥梁、涵洞、水塘等<span lang=\"EN-US\">6377</span>座，修建小型堤防、干渠<span lang=\"EN-US\">4230</span>公里，支持<span lang=\"EN-US\">631</span>个行政村开展美丽乡村整治提升。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}